  "title_zh": "习近平同缅甸总统敏昂莱会谈",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Holds Talks with Myanmar President Min Aung Hlaing",
  "summary_zh": "6月16日上午，国家主席习近平在北京人民大会堂同来华进行国事访问的缅甸总统敏昂莱举行会谈并举行欢迎仪式。",
  "summary_en": "On the morning of June 16, President Xi Jinping held talks and a welcome ceremony for Myanmar President Min Aung Hlaing, who is paying a state visit to China, at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing.",
